  "college_naive_caveat": "College rul_seconds = run_end_timestamp - event_timestamp, and the naive baseline predicts mean_total_life - elapsed. On an expanding window that always starts at the true t=0 those are algebraically the same formula, so naive scores MAE=0.0 by construction (docs/decisions.md D10). It is an oracle with access to the true total run length, not a fair comparison for ExtraTrees."
